<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAssociatedWith> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/properOverlaps> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "was associated with"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an activity to an agent that had some (unspecified) responsibility for the occurence of this activity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "wasAssociatedWith"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAssociatedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The activity is through overlapped by the agent."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/causedBy> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "was attributed to"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an entity to an agent via an activity that both the entity and agent participates to."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "wasAttributedTo"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The activity is through overlapped by the agent and overcrossed by the entity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This relation connects PROV-O with causal theory of the SSbD Core Ontology"@en .
