# https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/ModernGenerativeAIModel> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/TextGeneration> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LLM"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A specialized subset of Generative Artificial Intelligence that is fundamentally defined by its use of transformer architecture (specifically encoders, decoders, or both) to process and generate human-like text by predicting the next token in a sequence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/LargeLanguageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "LargeLanguageModel"@en .
