<https://w3id.org/ssbd/MarineAquaticEcotoxicityImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Marine aquatic ecotoxicity in Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) is an environmental impact category measuring the potential toxic effects of chemical emissions (from product manufacturing, use, or disposal) on marine ecosystems."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/MarineAquaticEcotoxicityImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MarineAquaticEcotoxicityImpactCategory"@en .
