<https://w3id.org/ssbd/MarineEutrophicationImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Marine Eutrophication in Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) is an environmental impact category measuring the potential impacts of nutrient enrichment in marine ecosystems leading to hypoxic waters causing far-reaching impacts, such as loss of biodiversity, habitat degradation, coral bleaching."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/MarineEutrophicationImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MarineEutrophicationImpactCategory"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/MarineEutrophicationImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This is a LCA impact category." .
