_:genid25 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/SustainabilityDimension> .
_:genid25 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/ssbd/assesses> .
_:genid25 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/ssbd/SustainabilityAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Sustainability Assessment"@en .
